[0.016, "o", "\u001b[?2026h\r\u001b[29A\u001b[K\n\u001b[90m────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\u001b[m\u001b[K\r\n\u001b[34;1m> /teach-code I know react, but I'd like to learn Flutter from this codebase.\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[K\n\u001b[37m○\u001b[m \u001b[37mThought for 15.2s\u001b[m \u001b[37m(Initial assessment requires understanding the codebase. Examining project files including docu...)\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[2C\u001b[33;1mRan\u001b[m \u001b[37m(ls -la)\u001b[m\u001b[K\n\u001b[12D\u001b[33;1mExplored\u001b[m 4 files \u001b[37m(MISSION-FORMAT.md, README.md, GLOSSARY.md, +1)\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[32m●\u001b[m \u001b[33;1mRan\u001b[m \u001b[37m(find lib test -type f)\u001b[m \u001b[37m(ctrl+o to expand)\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[K\n\u001b[37m▸ Thought for 10s, 437 tokens\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[K\n  This repository is an \u001b[1mElectronics Parts Tracker\u001b[m (\u001b[34;4m\u001b]8;id=jk568fcb1a1671ce1b;file:///Users/brett/Demos/flutter-parts-experiment/parts_tracker_comprehension/pubspec.yaml\u0007pubspec.yaml\u001b[m\u001b]8;;\u0007, \u001b[34;4m\u001b]8;id=jk3cdbc49437c0e402;file:///Users/brett/Demos/flutter-parts-experiment/parts_tracker_compreh"]
