[0.018, "o", "\u001b[?2026h\u001b[29A──────\r\n  \u001b[1m### Lesson 0001: Flutter Bootstrap, \u001b[94mProviderScope\u001b[39m & Dark Workbench Shell\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[K\n  • \u001b[1mInteractive Lesson\u001b[m: \u001b[34;4m\u001b]8;id=jk37305125bcd158bd;file:///Users/brett/Demos/flutter-parts-experiment/parts_tracker_comprehension/tutorial/lessons/0001-flutter-bootstrap-and-provider-scope.html\u00070001-flutter-bootstrap-and-provider-scope.html\u001b[m\u001b]8;;\u0007 (\u001b[34;4m\u001b]8;id=jkc90f909846bd82a6;file:///Users/brett/Demos/flutter-parts-experiment/parts_tracker_comprehension/tutorial/lessons/0001-flutter-bootstrap-and-provider-scope.md\u0007Markdown source\u001b[m\u001b]8;;\u0007)\r\n      • Maps \u001b[94mpackage.json\u001b[m + \u001b[94mtsconfig.json\u001b[m to \u001b[34;4m\u001b]8;id=jkf536cb3c1d79af45;file:///Users/brett/Demos/flutter-parts-experiment/parts_tracker_comprehension/tutorial/apps/0001-flutter-bootstrap-and-provider-scope/pubspec.yaml\u0007pubspec.yaml\u001b[m\u001b]8;;\u0007 and \u001b[34;4m\u001b]8;id=jk570cf86a721f899b;file:///Users/brett/Demos/flutter-parts-experiment/parts_tracker_comprehension/tutorial/apps/0001-flutter-bootstrap-and-prov"]
