[0.000, "o", "\r\n  to render them.\").\r\n  • \u001b[94mcross-document-transitions\u001b[m: I wrapped \u001b[94m@view-transition { navigation: auto; }\u001b[m inside \u001b[94m@media (prefers-reduced-\u001b[m\r\n  \u001b[94mmotion: no-preference)\u001b[m in \u001b[94mtutorial/assets/style.css\u001b[m so multi-page navigations between the course index, lessons,\r\n  and reference sheets cross-fade smoothly without violating motion preferences (\"Both the source and destination\r\n  pages must opt-in to view transitions for the browser to trigger them on navigation.\").\r\n  • \u001b[94mcss\u001b[m: I organized \u001b[94mtutorial/assets/style.css\u001b[m into explicit \u001b[94m@layer base, theme, layout, components, utilities, \u001b[m\r\n  \u001b[94mprint;\u001b[m priority zones, used \u001b[94m:not(:disabled)\u001b[m on button hover states, and scoped \u001b[94mbox-sizing: border-box\u001b[m to explicit\r\n  eleme\r\n⣯  \u001b[90mWorking...\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[90m└ Tip: Press ctrl+g to open an external editor for long prompts.\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[90m──────────────────────────────────────────"]
