[0.000, "o", " Atomic I/O\"\u001b[K\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[37m  \u001b[90m  6 \u001b[39;48;2;14;52;15m \u001b[32m+  \u001b[39msubtitle: \"Design a deep persistence module (CatalogPersistence) with an in-memory test double and an atomic,\u001b[K\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[5C\u001b[37m\u001b[1K \u001b[48;2;14;52;15m \u001b[32m   \u001b[39mserialized file writer (FileCatalogPersistence) using Dart Futures and Completers.\"\u001b[K\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[37m  \u001b[90m  7 \u001b[39;48;2;14;52;15m \u001b[32m+  \u001b[39mcard:\u001b[K\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[37m  \u001b[90m  8 \u001b[39;48;2;14;52;15m \u001b[32m+  \u001b[39m  title: \"**Persistence Seam & Atomic Local File Storage**\"\u001b[K\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[37m  \u001b[90m  9 \u001b[39;48;2;14;52;15m \u001b[32m+  \u001b[39m  summary: \"Build CatalogPersistence, InMemoryCatalogPersistence, and FileCatalogPersistence with a serialized\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[5C\u001b[37m\u001b[1K \u001b[48;2;14;52;15m \u001b[32m   \u001b[39m  Completer write queue, atomic .tmp rename, and backup/export support.\"\u001b[K\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[37m  \u001b[90m 10 \u001b[39;48;2;14;52;15m \u001b[32m+  \u001b[39m---\u001b[K\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[37m  \u001b[90m 11 \u001b[39;48;2;14;52;15m \u001b[32m+  \u001b[39m\u001b[K\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[37m  \u001b[90m 12 \u001b[39;48;2;14;52;15m \u001b[32m+  \u001b[39m## Why Put a Seam Between State and Disk I/O? {\u001b[38;2;181;188;197m#why\u001b"]
[0.000, "o", "[39m-seam}\u001b[K\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[37m  \u001b[90m 13 \u001b[39;48;2;14;52;15m \u001b[32m+  \u001b[39m\u001b[K\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[37m  \u001b[90m 14 \u001b[39;48;2;14;52;15m \u001b[32m+  \u001b[39mIn a browser React app, you might persist small state blobs to \u001b[38;2;151;198;123m`localStorage`\u001b[39m or \u001b[38;2;151;198;123m`IndexedDB`\u001b[39m. On mobile and\u001b[K\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[5C\u001b[37m\u001b[1K \u001b[48;2;14;52;15m \u001b[32m   \u001b[39mdesktop (iOS/macOS), our Electronics Parts Tracker stores the user's catalog in a pretty-printed\u001b[K\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[5C\u001b[37m\u001b[1K \u001b[48;2;14;52;15m \u001b[32m   \u001b[38;2;151;198;123m`parts_catalog.json`\u001b[39m file inside the app's documents directory—and lets the user export or import timestamped\u001b[K\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[5C\u001b[37m\u001b[1K \u001b[48;2;14;52;15m \u001b[32m   \u001b[39mJSON backups via the native OS share sheet and file picker.\u001b[K\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[37m  \u001b[90m 15 \u001b[39;48;2;14;52;15m \u001b[32m+  \u001b[39m\u001b[K\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[90m  … 471 more lines (f for full diff)\u001b[m\u001b[K\r\n\u001b[K\n\u001b[1mAllow creation of this file?\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[94m> 1. Yes, allow creation\u001b[K\u001b[m\r\n  2. No, deny creation\r\n\u001b[K\n  \u001b[94;1m↑/↓\u001b[90;22m Navigate · \u001b[94;1mtab\u001b[90;22m Amend · \u001b[94;1mf\u001b[90;22m "]
