[0.000, "o", "2m+  \u001b[39m\u001b[K\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[37m  \u001b[90m 12 \u001b[39;48;2;14;52;15m \u001b[32m+  \u001b[39m## How Riverpod Unifies TanStack Query and Zustand/Redux {\u001b[38;2;181;188;197m#why\u001b[39m-riverpod}\u001b[K\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[37m  \u001b[90m 13 \u001b[39;48;2;14;52;15m \u001b[32m+  \u001b[39m\u001b[K\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[37m  \u001b[90m 14 \u001b[39;48;2;14;52;15m \u001b[32m+  \u001b[39mIn a modern React application, you typically split state management across two different mental models:\u001b[K\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[37m  \u001b[90m 15 \u001b[39;48;2;14;52;15m \u001b[32m+  \u001b[39m\u001b[K\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[37m  \u001b[90m 16 \u001b[39;48;2;14;52;15m \u001b[32m+  \u001b[39m1. **Async / I/O state (`useQuery` / TanStack Query)**: Manages loading spinners, error states, and async\u001b[K\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[5C\u001b[37m\u001b[1K \u001b[48;2;14;52;15m \u001b[32m   \u001b[39mresolution (\u001b[38;2;151;198;123m`{ data, isLoading, error }`\u001b[39m).\u001b[K\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[90m  … 379 more lines (f for full diff)\u001b[m\u001b[K\r\n\u001b[K\n\u001b[1mAllow creation of this file?\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[94m> 1. Yes, allow creation\u001b[K\u001b[m\r\n  2. No, deny creation\r\n\u001b[K\n  \u001b[94;1m↑/↓\u001b[90;22m Navigate · \u001b[94;1mtab\u001b[90;22m Amend · \u001b[94;1mf\u001b[90;22m full diff\u001b[m\u001b[K\r\n\u001b[90mesc to cancel\u001b[m\u001b[84X\u001b[84C\u001b[2mGemini 4"]
